Third-party detection rules
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
rules/sigma/sigmahq/ contains unmodified rules from the SigmaHQ project
(https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma), licensed under the Detection Rule License
(DRL) 1.1 - see rules/sigma/sigmahq/LICENSE. Authors as stated in each rule:
  - win_security_audit_log_cleared.yml            - Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
  - win_security_user_added_to_local_administrators.yml - Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
  - lnx_privileged_user_creation.yml               - Pawel Mazur
SentinelOps shows author, origin and licence of these rules in the rule view,
the generated detection catalogue and every case report.

